\description{
Compares each label's genes between the design's groups, in the Cohort view, with the replicate unit (not the cell) as the unit, as an artifact of kind expression made from the summary: each label's pseudobulk (its cells' transcripts summed over each unit's samples) over the genes every panel has, in the units with enough of its cells; genes filtered by expression (a count of 10 over the median library size in the smallest group's number of units, and 15 in all); TMM normalization; voom's precision weights; each gene's weighted model of the design (its pairing and covariates) and limma's moderated t, its variance moderated toward the genes' prior; each contrast's log2 fold change with its interval, and p-values adjusted by Benjamini and Hochberg over every label, gene and contrast tested, the universe said. A label in too few units is left untested, with the reason. The design is the Cohort view's draft unless a saved one is named. Answers each label's genes below an adjusted p of 0.05 (and the 10 lowest p's of each), its units, genes tested and prior.
}
